    "Top-level code loads ServerManager, attempts RSAT-AD-PowerShell installation by two cmdlets, then loads ActiveDirectory and GroupPolicy.",
    "Get-ADDomain obtains DNSRoot and DistinguishedName. Nested catches attempt Win32_ComputerSystem.Domain and USERDNSDOMAIN fallbacks; nonterminating AD errors are not explicitly promoted to terminating errors.",
